WEBVTT

00:10:59.212 --> 00:11:02.615
"I have decided I want to be a magician.

00:11:02.639 --> 00:11:05.760
I want to perform
magic tricks on the stage."

00:11:07.322 --> 00:11:08.759
(Laughter)

00:11:08.783 --> 00:11:10.347
And what do you say?

00:11:11.156 --> 00:11:13.631
You say, you say,

00:11:13.655 --> 00:11:16.978
"That's risky, kid.

00:11:17.002 --> 00:11:19.801
Might fail, kid. Don't make
a lot of money at that, kid.

00:11:19.825 --> 00:11:22.793
I don't know, kid, you should
think about that again, kid.

00:11:22.817 --> 00:11:24.792
You're so good at math, why don't you --"

00:11:24.816 --> 00:11:26.350
The kid interrupts you and says,

00:11:26.374 --> 00:11:29.722
"But it is my dream.
It is my dream to do this."